<div class="ebooks-page"><div class="ebooks-wrap"><section class="ebooks-hero"><div><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#aaa2ff">DIGITAL READING</span><h1>eBooks for every mood.</h1><p><?= !empty($is_ebook_table) ? 'Browse the digital titles currently available in your catalog.' : 'Your eBook table is not configured yet, so BookSpot is showing New Arrivals here as a graceful fallback.'; ?></p></div><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open" style="font-size:62px;color:#9e97ff"></i></section>
